{"n":1,"at":"2026-11-11T19:30:00Z","by":"prima-kernel-seed","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.0000.00.draft","tail":"draft","reason":"sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.","body":"---\naddress: 10.11.21.0000\ntitle: about-me\ntype: system\nstate: draft\nwhy-draft: sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.\n---\n\n## Registry\nfaces: -\nlevel: book\n\nR10 (DIRECTOR-RULINGS.md:40), R12 (:53) and R19 (:75): face 00 holds the stamp, the page type and the registry. Layout follows docs/spec/face00.md (DRAFT, not ruled): `why-draft` and `why-NN` are PROPOSED names there; `seat-NN` is the build's own (`7`, QUESTIONS Q34); per-type registry fields are not written (`7`, Q33); `faces:` is written here and checked by the builder against the files (written vs derived is `7`, face00.md F2, CONFLICTS D5).","proposal":"prima-kernel-seed:10.11.21.0000"}
{"n":2,"at":"2026-11-11T19:30:00Z","by":"prima-kernel-seed","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.0012.00.draft","tail":"draft","reason":"sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.","body":"---\naddress: 10.11.21.0012\ntitle: dictionary\ntype: pointer\nstate: draft\nwhy-draft: sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.\n---\n\n## Registry\nfaces: 03.14 draft, 03.16 draft, 05.01 seated, 05.02 seated\nseat-05.01: approved-by: build-stage (R2); trial: docs/trial/kernel-trial-4.md blob a5d253d5e12722956afea38e79cb7fc1cf492c7b; blob: 9aaed75fc8f0594a1289fa83e870a474d4d021d2\nseat-05.02: approved-by: build-stage (R2); trial: docs/trial/kernel-trial-5.md blob 86eb3a58e028d9b23e0a94cd4577329195300f99; blob: dd89a5199d1a0b47f5cac3bce2ec0e8185ff1ce6\nwhy-03.14: sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.\nwhy-03.16: sample fixture for the build, not kernel content; nobody has reviewed it.\n\nR10 (DIRECTOR-RULINGS.md:40), R12 (:53) and R19 (:75): face 00 holds the stamp, the page type and the registry. Layout follows docs/spec/face00.md (DRAFT, not ruled): `why-draft` and `why-NN` are PROPOSED names there; `seat-NN` is the build's own (`7`, QUESTIONS Q34); per-type registry fields are not written (`7`, Q33); `faces:` is written here and checked by the builder against the files (written vs derived is `7`, face00.md F2, CONFLICTS D5).","proposal":"prima-kernel-seed:10.11.21.0012"}
